# Crash Bandicoot 2 - Cortex Strikes Back (USA) [SCUS-94154]
[60FPS patch (experimental)]
Type = Gameshark
Activation = EndFrame
Author = alexdass/mandude
Description = Disables the second VSync per frame and doubles CPU clock, allowing the game to run its built-in 60FPS mode. NOTE: Not all game objects were programmed with this in mind.
OverrideCPUOverclock = 200
